s and times</h5>\n        <h4>24 July-24 July</h4>\n      </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"banner-wrapper\">\n    <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"https://d2gbygv6wnrxcy.cloudfront.net/new-dugdale-arts-centre/events/banner/_eventBanner/1345208/Web_Banner-2.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <img\n        class=\"event-banner\"\n        alt=\"Web Banner 2\"\n        src=\"https://d2gbygv6wnrxcy.cloudfront.net/new-dugdale-arts-centre/events/banner/Web_Banner-2.jpg\"\n                type=\"image/jpg\"\n    />\n</picture>  </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h4><a href=\"/whats-on\">< Back to events</a></h4>\n            <div class=\"iframe-wrapper\">\n          <iframe\n              name=\"SpektrixIFrame\"\n              id=\"SpektrixIFrame\"\n              src=\"https://tickets.dugdaleartscentre.co.uk/millfieldartscentre/website/EventDetails.aspx??resize=true&EventId=741130&Stylesheet=dugdale-spektrix-iframes.min.css&resize=true\"\n              frameborder=\"0\"\n              scrolling=\"yes\"\n              style=\"width: 100%; height: 1000px;\"\n          ></iframe>\n      </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n    <footer id=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <h2>Dugdale<br/>Arts<br/>Centre</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"contact-details\">\n      <h3>Box office</h3>\n      <h2><a href=\"tel:08006403928\">0800 640 3928</a></h2>\n      <h6><a href=\"mailto:culture@enfield.gov.uk\">culture@enfield.gov.uk</a></h6>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"address\">\n      <h6>Dugdale Arts Centre,<br/>39 London Road,<br />Enfield,<br />EN2 6DS</h6>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"socials\">\n      <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/DAC_Enfield\"><img class=\"social-icon\" alt=\"Twitter\" src=\"/assets/images/icons/twitter.svg\" /></a>\n      <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dugdaleartscentre/\"><img class=\"social-icon\" alt=\"Instagra